{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195770/extras/WishlistGif.gif?t=1743943711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this humorous and unique simulation game, you take on the role of an unusual protagonist - a tree! Roam through the city, experience the freedom of movement and explore a world that lies at your roots. But that's not all. As a tree, cause chaos and influence your surroundings in a whole new way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Be a Tree outside the city</u></strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more you are a tree, the more you will see. And there is a lot to see.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195770/extras/Tree_Simulator_Gif2_Masked.gif?t=1743943711\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Be a Tree in front of Jeffrey the T-Rex</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jeffrey lives alone and is therefore irritable. Jeffrey hates plants without effect and therefore attacks them, typical Jeffrey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195770/extras/DinoAttackGif_Resized_Masked.gif?t=1743943711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Be immortalized as a Tree</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn to be immortalized as a tree forever by getting a name on a monument. Only real trees make it to the grave.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195770/extras/Monument_Gif_Optimized_masked.gif?t=1743943711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Be a Tree in the City</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb buildings, discover hidden places and enjoy the unusual perspective of an urban environment. The demo offers a first insight into the special game mechanics that give you unimagined freedom and creative fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195770/extras/Gif2_Masked.gif?t=1743943711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features of the Demo</strong>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be a tree  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throw people, cars or not  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet a <strong>variety</strong> of <strong>events</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet TreesaurusRex?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch squirrels make dirty-mirty ding-dongs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climbing houses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and more.. way more... </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to tear the city from its roots?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be a tree, be, <strong>The Tree</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3195770?t=1743943711","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3195770?t=1743943711","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195770/93d502e532b86fc916938a3be6dc77e1bec77a59/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743943711","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195770/93d502e532b86fc916938a3be6dc77e1bec77a59/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743943711","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player